{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0104_1000_p", "source_sha256": "87f77ebd6d3e99f6582aea94c25b3d9218bfd56d3652ea62520ec5ae98e975f1", "ja": "（これから、お菓子メーカーが主催する、\nひな祭りイベントのPV撮影だ）", "zh": "（接下来要拍摄糖果厂商\n主办的女儿节活动PV。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0104_1001_011ami", "source_sha256": "442624c4ca407fa308332b1dea948a0b8b6968260e362e55ebccba889debbc16", "ja": "今日ってたしか、ひなあられ、ひし餅、ひなケーキ、\nひなカレー、ひなステーキ食べ放題のお仕事だよね？", "zh": "亚美记得今天的工作是尽情吃雏米果、菱饼、\n雏蛋糕、雏咖哩，还有雏牛排对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0104_1002_011ami", "source_sha256": "417785feef41e9ee0b83f3ac4d7e9e933ea763de5af12137deb2fb597aa6c8bb", "ja": "そんでそんで、食べたら感想言うんだよね？\nもぐもぐ……うーん、おいしくってテイスティー！", "zh": "然后呢然后呢，就是吃完说感想对不对？\n嚼嚼嚼……嗯──好好吃，太美味了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0104_1003_011ami", "source_sha256": "50b11b1cd7588c92e198b5312c6c61a67a2ba1fcb49e4b1ed6551c9d9144c9cc", "ja": "このウマさ、まさにデリシャス！\n店主を呼べ！　おかわり！！", "zh": "这种味道正是Delicious！\n叫老板出来！再来一碗！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0104_1004_p", "source_sha256": "687b21a3f24faa96db022fe7235faa9c35e7ce68b4e00767304888103f39f8df", "ja": "びっくりするくらい違うぞ……。そうじゃなくて、\nこのイベントの内容をちゃんと紹介するんだ。", "zh": "错得让人大吃一惊……\n不是这样，要好好介绍这次的活动内容啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0104_1005_p", "source_sha256": "4e7a196abe525d17119b57c81241a0695cd4fafd03dcc7ce2d13182538a358e1", "ja": "今回は特に、ひなあられの手作り体験が\nできるっていうのをアピールしたいらしい。", "zh": "厂商这次似乎想要重点宣传\n体验亲手制作雏米果的活动。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0104_1006_011ami", "source_sha256": "5516025c08693febb6e89026d1c2fef99881d964521daa6a0a3db899b6df78e4", "ja": "え～。なんかマジメだよ兄ちゃん～。\nマジのメ～さんだよ～。", "zh": "咦～大哥哥怎么正经八百的～\n是正经的八百日圆喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0104_1007_p", "source_sha256": "ab2a180b68466c8bd9b77e30864f7d646e1d8591ba4c9e55062348d224b2b0e8", "ja": "ちゃんとやりつつ、楽しくやってくれればいいんだよ。\nその方が亜美の良さも出るだろうし。", "zh": "你只要按部就班，开心体验制作过程就好。\n这样应该最能展现出亚美的优点吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0104_1008_011ami", "source_sha256": "9c957a36727a4b440521462f49a3746b36a28f92901089facf8d825d2a6c951a", "ja": "え、それでいいの？　オッケーオッケー、遊びなら\n亜美にオマカセだよ！　ほんじゃ、行ってくんねー！", "zh": "咦？这样就可以了吗？OK、OK，\n就交给亚美来玩耍吧！那亚美去玩啰──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0104_1009_p", "source_sha256": "a375bfe645aea8040e25508b4129a85f2ef5568db8af6a2bca53c678cb2cca26", "ja": "いや、楽しくとは言ったが、遊びとは……。\n行ってしまった。大丈夫かな……。", "zh": "不是，我是说开心制作，不是叫你去玩……\n走掉了，她没问题吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0104_1010_011ami", "source_sha256": "8c254bac6c8b8e52df6185aff95ee87b0a76e185052bb8e3f3c1afa26824f563", "ja": "いぇーい、撮影しゅーりょー！\nねえねえ兄ちゃん、亜美の大カツヤク、見てた？", "zh": "耶──拍摄结束！\n欸欸大哥哥，你有看见亚美大显身手吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0104_1011_011ami", "source_sha256": "f2df10b2f89d8db37f34a0aa6409c77cf6bbe59201bc5a7acd88567ecd0f8563", "ja": "チョーいろんなひなあられ作っちゃった！\nイチゴ味とか、カレー味とか、ステーキ味とか～。", "zh": "亚美做了超多种雏米果！\n有草莓口味、咖哩口味，还有牛排口味之类的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0104_1012_011ami", "source_sha256": "22acb5982765c7294816db2e72ef2e6406d38cf0c103c558894c4981d4028885", "ja": "いろんな材料を混ぜたら、世界初の味が\nポンポンできるから、メッチャ楽しかったー！", "zh": "把各式各样的材料混在一起，\n就能做出许多世界首创的口味，超级好玩的──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0104_1013_p", "source_sha256": "0e9261f5a3d4740c5d64f80cba0f3fb01b352732b2d68bd5b109bfbbdb06165a", "ja": "うん、メーカーの人も、こういう新発見ができるって\nことを伝えてもらえたって、すごく喜んでたよ。", "zh": "嗯，厂商方面也非常高兴，\n说你成功表现出这个活动充满新发现的一面。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0104_1014_011ami", "source_sha256": "56d04c180bb3e97da9029be9228cac7968d8d84fb41ebbfc0eb510971e0decb1", "ja": "んっふっふ～♪　しかも、作ったひなあられは\n持って帰っていいんだって！", "zh": "嗯哼哼～♪\n而且他们还说亚美可以把做出来的雏米果带回去喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0104_1015_011ami", "source_sha256": "b7615dbe4e39638236cc98e04bdd16a204ccc4fa7558c2e860868120810595ef", "ja": "劇場に持って帰って、みんなにあげよっと！\nいっぱいあるから、車に積みこんでいい？", "zh": "亚美要带回去剧场，分给大家！\n量很多，亚美可以搬到车子里吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0104_1016_p", "source_sha256": "0b56daf3fff1bdcb549066f9e8da0236a5d6ef3b2d1c312f1e1acd35b17fd959", "ja": "ああ、もちろん。みんな喜ぶな。\nさて、じゃあそろそろ引き上げるか。", "zh": "嗯，当然可以，大家会很高兴吧。\n好了，我们差不多该离开了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0104_1017_011ami", "source_sha256": "e3c16c9353e5a81cb9c1eb4493a61633917544f9c889ba484c2d1e19866fca3f", "ja": "あ、待って、兄ちゃん。\n……はい、これ！", "zh": "啊，等一下，大哥哥。\n……来，这给你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0104_1029", "source_sha256": "72581708f4a5c9f944f2121956fbfb746fd61b265cb305e76f64a4a968f4a7f8", "ja": "受け取る", "zh": "收下", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0104_1018_011ami", "source_sha256": "b4326d02deeff5c7598fc150439fb08ce204460255af39f5f45274017dae4ad4", "ja": "いつもがんばってる兄ちゃんに、ひなひな亜美から\n手作りひなあられのプレゼントでおじゃる♪", "zh": "大哥哥总是很努力，\n就让后后亚美送你亲手做的雏米果吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0104_1019_011ami", "source_sha256": "883f0d49d796fc9db575e215da185db864ce0e67d30a7dbccacb0f6e6b7cdc57", "ja": "兄ちゃんのアドバイスのおかげで、\nうまくいったぞよ。ほめてつかわすぞよ。それと……。", "zh": "多亏大哥哥的建议，\n拍摄才这么顺利，值得表扬。还有……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0104_1020_011ami", "source_sha256": "7ea8539946bad802657d8d2f98990685b79a955a1b9921da45fd05b34e8b4fb8", "ja": "……えへへ。あんがとね！", "zh": "……嘿嘿，谢谢你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0104_1021_p", "source_sha256": "bec976652cd946591453f11755ca594ecf76f6919ae285ea1cfefeff2a8587de", "ja": "あっ、亜美？", "zh": "亚、亚美？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0104_1022_p", "source_sha256": "e45d1c8372514b9e1adf178779d0dd2d6623ea68beca241f65f8ca88b6949310", "ja": "（……いびつな形のひなあられだ。\n正直、そんなに美味しい見た目にはみえない）", "zh": "（……雏米果的形状歪七扭八。\n老实说，外表看上去不是很好吃。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0104_1023_p", "source_sha256": "fb8aaec7999d0ab122f096964d7e545959bbed540e9c166a0e4cc7f6b7f77113", "ja": "（だが、ありがたくいただくとしよう。この形が\n亜美なりの、俺に対する労いなのだろうから）", "zh": "（但我就抱着感激的心品尝吧。\n毕竟这个形状是亚美为了慰劳我而努力做出来的。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0104_1024_p", "source_sha256": "5b73946aaf39953951dec4887a963555078237cf0dcb307d3628eeee71c36ee5", "ja": "（……ポリポリ）", "zh": "（……卡滋卡滋）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0104_1026_011ami", "source_sha256": "686379c3c6e19082957b806f6d33e17711abe917b678edd9dac2cc5ea0530b65", "ja": "おおっ、さすが兄ちゃん！\nさっそく食べてくれるとは、うれしいね～！", "zh": "哦哦，不愧是大哥哥！\n马上就吃下去了，真让人开心～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0104_1027_011ami", "source_sha256": "3254cf86fe7be90cc16d7ae2283f9be58125d150d20ee47ebab45faf03ed1e80", "ja": "亜美特製ブレンド、超絶最強激辛悶絶ひなあられだよ！\nどうどう、おいしい？", "zh": "这是亚美特制的超绝最强激辣气绝雏米果喔！\n怎么样怎么样？好吃吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
